86
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,800
These mice are pests.

87
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:37,780
They can disrupt experiments with the bacterial organisms they carry.

88
00:07:38,740 --> 00:07:42,800
They are bad mice and must be captured and destroyed.

89
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:50,000
Usually, this is accomplished by means of sticky traps, a kind of fly paper on which

90
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,020
