97
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:29,960
In Herzog's own home, there was a more ironic example.

98
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:36,460
When his young son's pet mouse, Willie, died recently, it was accorded a tearful

99
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:38,600
